{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今集《流行都市》「睇餸食飯」環節有 Leslie陳國賓 教大家做「鮮粟米粒椰香帆立貝」。鮮甜的帆立貝配搭香濃的鮮粟米汁與減脂椰漿，加上豐富烤香的蔬菜，層次分明，風味獨特，大家快來試做吧！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">食材</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">材料：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">帆立貝 6粒</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">珍珠蜆 適量</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">粟米 1條半</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">甘筍 適量</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">南瓜件 80克</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">青翠玉瓜 100克</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">秋葵 4條</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">煙肉粒 1湯匙</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蒜蓉 1湯匙</p></li></ul></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">調味：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鹽 1/3茶匙</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">黑胡椒 少量</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">減脂椰漿 2/3杯</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">百里香 2棵</p></li></ul></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">做法</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9fa2ad47-27e1-4c20-9ccd-fd8194c04162.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026DskhZYicYH1784713232.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9fa2ad47-27e1-4c20-9ccd-fd8194c04162.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3f3df2b5-6a18-47d0-a1bf-43ad5c9a0832.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026vMwDVkEI3T1784713236.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3f3df2b5-6a18-47d0-a1bf-43ad5c9a0832.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-23T06:19:04.119346+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}